WEBVTT

00:09:29.985 --> 00:09:31.748
Ron McCallum: Isn't that slow?

00:09:31.748 --> 00:09:32.718
(Laughter)

00:09:32.718 --> 00:09:34.986
You see, if I read like that, I'd fall asleep.

00:09:34.986 --> 00:09:36.195
I slowed it down for you.

00:09:36.195 --> 00:09:39.467
I'm going to ask that we play it at the speed I read it.

00:09:39.467 --> 00:09:41.982
Can we play that one?

00:09:41.982 --> 00:09:46.737
(JAWS speaking)

00:09:55.809 --> 00:09:57.832
(Laughter)

00:09:57.832 --> 00:09:59.653
RM: You know, when you're marking student essays,

00:09:59.653 --> 00:10:01.570
you want to get through them fairly quickly.